{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight other players in a fast paced environment with gravity that behaves differently across various maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the weapon you like the most and dominate the lobby with your skills! Kick, grab, grapple and shoot other players in to their doom.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different maps, with a big variety in between, will allow you to express your ability against in unique ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of customization to the gameplay for every lobby will allow you to explore many experiences.<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932480/extras/782dee4691b1c955e3d3e09420edcc39.poster.avif?t=1772460021\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932480/extras/782dee4691b1c955e3d3e09420edcc39.webm?t=1772460021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932480/extras/782dee4691b1c955e3d3e09420edcc39.mp4?t=1772460021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swing like a yoyo around the map and use its obstacles to sling shot yourself across the world.</strong><br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932480/extras/18b2a81fda163c2873da4421e7f20be1.poster.avif?t=1772460021\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932480/extras/18b2a81fda163c2873da4421e7f20be1.webm?t=1772460021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932480/extras/18b2a81fda163c2873da4421e7f20be1.mp4?